  "title": "Clients by Design",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Clients by Design"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Clients By Design** is a transformational coaching program designed to give you the plan, tactics, support, coaching, and accountability you need to grow a six-figure (or multi-six-figure) freelance business. Below are the major elements included in this program, but feel free to reach out if you have specific questions about any of this."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your Tailor-Made Continuous Clients Marketing Roadmap"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This includes a full deep-dive business and marketing audit where we'll identify all the missing pieces, learn what is currently working for you, and create your **Continuous Clients Marketing Roadmap**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This roadmap will guide you away from the uncertainty of where you are now toward a reliable, repeatable way to get a consistent flow of clients on your calendar every single month."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Our Systematic Step-By-Step Client Acquisition Playbooks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "These playbooks are built from the ground up specifically for this coaching program (and can’t be accessed anywhere else). They include what’s actually working in the field today and contain my step-by-step recipes for building your client acquisition machine."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Our playbooks help you with things like:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Choosing the best niche for you"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Creating a service offering that’s so good, people feel stupid saying “no”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Creating a lead generation system that reliably brings in leads"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Creating a sales roadmap that helps you turn strangers into clients"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Creating an automated lead nurturing system that passively builds trust with leads while you focus on the rest of your business"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Step-by-step paid advertising playbooks to help you promote anything to anybody"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And more..."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Transformational Coaching"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It’s time to stop working alone in a damp, dark cave. During our time together, you’ll be meeting with us every single week to break through roadblocks you’ve encountered due to fear, uncertainty, confusion, overwhelm, self-doubt, imposter syndrome, and all the other pesky barriers holding you back from implementing our transformational client acquisition strategies in your business."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Unlimited 1-on-1 Feedback to Keep Up Your Momentum and Confidence"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Need our eyes on something? You can submit anything you’re working on and we’ll give you feedback on what’s missing, what needs to be improved, and what’s good to go. This includes (but isn’t limited to):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Website/landing page copy"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pricing and packaging your services"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Niche pivots"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Overcoming sales issues"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Content you plan on releasing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ideas you think are awesome (but might be distractions 😉)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How to handle a particularly difficult client"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And way more..."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When it comes to feedback requests, the sky’s the limit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Absolute Accountability™"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Our program is built around taking action, which is why you always have a next step assigned to you along with a due date. We consistently follow up and check in to make sure you follow through."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you encounter any roadblocks or problems, we’re available every single week to help you solve those problems with personalized coaching."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Additional Resources (100% Free to Our Clients)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A full-featured marketing platform to host all:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Websites and funnels"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Booking/scheduling tools"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Email list and email marketing automation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pre-made website, funnel, and email marketing templates (save 20+ hours)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A Funnel Mapping Simulator (for advanced clients who want to venture into paid advertising)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A $500 paid ads budget (we’ll cover your first $500 if you’re following our playbooks)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Three 1-on-1 kickoff calls to get you up and running with all your questions answered"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Our Three Guarantees to You"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **The Continuous Clients Marketing Roadmap Approval Guarantee**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If we can’t create a roadmap that you’re 100% excited to implement and approve of, we’ll refund your entire investment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **The ROI Guarantee**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you execute your marketing roadmap and don’t get an additional $10k worth of clients you wouldn’t have otherwise acquired, we’ll keep coaching you for free until you do."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **The 100 Leads Guarantee**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you execute your marketing roadmap and don’t generate at least 100 new leads, we’ll refund your entire investment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
